{"seq":1,"slug":"data-product-spec","title":"数据产品规格设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/data-product-spec","wordCount":1126,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据产品规格设计\">数据产品规格设计</h1><p>数据产品规格（Data Product Specification）是数据网格的工程契约核心。它以机器可读的形式描述一个数据产品的完整接口：输入来源、输出端口、服务等级目标、血缘关系和元数据。本文讲解如何设计和维护数据产品规格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据产品的六大特征\">数据产品的六大特征</h2><p>Dehghani 定义了数据产品必须具备的六项特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>可发现（Discoverable）</strong></td>\n<td>消费者可以找到这个数据产品</td>\n<td>数据目录注册 + 搜索元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可寻址（Addressable）</strong></td>\n<td>有唯一的、稳定的访问地址</td>\n<td>统一的 output port URI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可信赖（Trustworthy）</strong></td>\n<td>有可观测的质量指标和 SLO</td>\n<td>质量监控 + SLA 报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自描述（Self-describing）</strong></td>\n<td>包含足够的语义信息供消费者理解</td>\n<td>schema + 业务词汇 + 示例数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>互操作（Interoperable）</strong></td>\n<td>符合全局标准，可与其他数据产品组合</td>\n<td>标准格式 + 规范 schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>安全受控（Secure）</strong></td>\n<td>访问控制符合安全策略</td>\n<td>RBAC + 数据分级标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据产品规格-yaml-结构\">数据产品规格 YAML 结构</h2><p>以下是一个完整的数据产品规格示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# data-products/order-events/spec.yaml&#10;apiVersion: data-mesh/v1alpha2&#10;kind: DataProduct&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-events&#10;  domain: order&#10;  owner: &#39;order-platform-team&#39;&#10;  ownerEmail: &#39;order-data@company.com&#39;&#10;  version: &#39;2.3.1&#39;&#10;  tags: [&#39;orders&#39;, &#39;ecommerce&#39;, &#39;transactional&#39;]&#10;  description: &#39;订单生命周期事件流，记录从下单到完成的所有状态变更&#39;&#10;&#10;# 输入端口：数据产品的数据来源&#10;inputPorts:&#10;  - id: order-service-db&#10;    type: database_change_capture&#10;    description: &#39;从订单服务 PostgreSQL 通过 Debezium CDC 捕获&#39;&#10;    sourceRef: &#39;postgresql://order-db.internal:5432/orders&#39;&#10;    tables:&#10;      - orders&#10;      - order_items&#10;    format: debezium-json&#10;    refreshPolicy:&#10;      type: streaming&#10;      latencyTarget: &#39;PT5S&#39;&#10;&#10;  - id: payment-events-topic&#10;    type: kafka_topic&#10;    description: &#39;从支付域消费支付完成事件，丰富订单状态&#39;&#10;    sourceRef: &#39;kafka://kafka.internal:9092/payment.events.v1&#39;&#10;    format: avro&#10;    schemaRef: &#39;schema-registry://payment-events-v1&#39;&#10;&#10;# 转换逻辑（可选，用于文档化）&#10;transformations:&#10;  - step: denormalize&#10;    description: &#39;将 orders + order_items JOIN 为宽表事件&#39;&#10;    engine: Apache Flink&#10;    lagTarget: &#39;PT10S&#39;&#10;  - step: enrich&#10;    description: &#39;用 payment 事件补充 is_paid 状态&#39;&#10;&#10;# 输出端口：消费者使用的接口&#10;outputPorts:&#10;  - id: kafka-stream&#10;    type: kafka_topic&#10;    description: &#39;实时事件流，适合流处理消费&#39;&#10;    location: &#39;kafka://kafka.internal:9092/order.events.v2&#39;&#10;    format: avro&#10;    schema:&#10;      ref: &#39;schema-registry://order-events-v2&#39;&#10;      link: &#39;https://schema-registry.internal/subjects/order-events-v2&#39;&#10;    slo:&#10;      freshness:&#10;        description: &#39;P99 事件延迟 &lt; 30s&#39;&#10;        threshold: &#39;PT30S&#39;&#10;        measurement: &#39;event_time to consumer_visible_time&#39;&#10;      availability:&#10;        percentage: &#39;99.9%&#39;&#10;        measurement_window: &#39;30d&#39;&#10;      quality:&#10;        completeness: &#39;99.5%&#39; # 无缺失 order_id&#10;    access:&#10;      policy: rbac&#10;      roles: [&#39;data-analyst&#39;, &#39;ml-engineer&#39;, &#39;data-product-consumer&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - id: bigquery-table&#10;    type: bigquery_table&#10;    description: &#39;批量快照，适合 BI 报表消费&#39;&#10;    location: &#39;bq://company-dw.order_domain.order_events_v2&#39;&#10;    partitioning:&#10;      column: event_date&#10;      type: DAY&#10;    slo:&#10;      freshness:&#10;        description: &#39;每日 UTC 06:00 前完成当日数据&#39;&#10;        threshold: &#39;PT6H&#39; # 相对于 UTC 00:00&#10;      availability:&#10;        percentage: &#39;99.5%&#39;&#10;        measurement_window: &#39;30d&#39;&#10;    access:&#10;      policy: rbac&#10;      roles: [&#39;data-analyst&#39;, &#39;bi-team&#39;]&#10;&#10;# 血缘信息&#10;lineage:&#10;  upstreams:&#10;    - dataProductRef: &#39;postgresql://order-service/orders&#39;&#10;      domain: &#39;order&#39;&#10;      description: &#39;源操作型数据&#39;&#10;    - dataProductRef: &#39;kafka://payment.events.v1&#39;&#10;      domain: &#39;payment&#39;&#10;      description: &#39;支付事件输入&#39;&#10;  downstreams: # 由数据目录自动发现，此处为文档参考&#10;    - &#39;customer-order-summary&#39;&#10;    - &#39;ml-feature-store/order-features&#39;&#10;&#10;# 质量规则（链接到可执行定义）&#10;qualityRules:&#10;  ref: &#39;data-products/order-events/quality/rules.soda.yaml&#39;&#10;  lastValidated: &#39;2026-07-01T06:00:00Z&#39;&#10;  passRate: &#39;99.8%&#39;&#10;&#10;# 数据分类&#10;dataClassification:&#10;  sensitivity: INTERNAL&#10;  piiFields:&#10;    - field: &#39;user_id&#39;&#10;      type: &#39;indirect_identifier&#39;&#10;      handling: &#39;可出现，关联 PII 需审批&#39;&#10;  retentionPolicy:&#10;    days: 730&#10;    deletionStrategy: &#39;event_based_purge&#39;&#10;&#10;# 目录元数据&#10;catalog:&#10;  businessGlossaryRefs:&#10;    - term: &#39;Order&#39;&#10;      url: &#39;https://glossary.internal/order&#39;&#10;    - term: &#39;OrderStatus&#39;&#10;      url: &#39;https://glossary.internal/order-status&#39;&#10;  useCases:&#10;    - &#39;实时订单监控仪表盘&#39;&#10;    - &#39;订单完成率趋势分析&#39;&#10;    - &#39;ML 模型：订单取消预测特征&#39;&#10;  sampleDataRef: &#39;data-products/order-events/samples/sample_100.json&#39;&#10;  documentationUrl: &#39;https://datahub.internal/datasets/order-events&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># data-products/order-events/spec.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-mesh/v1alpha2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DataProduct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  domain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-platform-team'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ownerEmail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-data@company.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.3.1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ecommerce'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'transactional'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单生命周期事件流，记录从下单到完成的所有状态变更'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输入端口：数据产品的数据来源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">inputPorts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service-db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database_change_capture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'从订单服务 PostgreSQL 通过 Debezium CDC 捕获'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sourceRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'postgresql://order-db.internal:5432/orders'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tables</span><span style=\"color:#